WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.420
Your company runs in pieces.

2
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.430
A customer writes to one person.

3
00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.310
The plan sits with another.

4
00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.240
And things slip.

5
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.870
Start with your company.

6
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.680
HAI Seed gives your whole company
its own AI.

7
00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.500
HAI's first big job isn't a chat.

8
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.320
It reads everything you choose to connect,
then looks at the whole business,

9
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:52.450
through the eyes of finance, sales,
operations and customers.

10
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.307
It connects who said what,

11
00:00:54.307 --> 00:00:55.390
and what changed.

12
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:56.850
It checks each promise

13
00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.400
against the records.

14
00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.670
It shows what's wrong,

15
00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:01.740
where it found it, and how to fix it.

16
00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.400
That's one finding.

17
00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.320
There are more.

18
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.730
Each fix arrives prepared.

19
00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:11.240
You review, you decide.

20
00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:13.180
Your team acts.

21
00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.930
And it doesn't stop there.

22
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.270
The checks you agree on keep running.

23
00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.610
HAI reports on its own.

24
00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:23.430
When a task keeps coming back,
HAI offers to build an agent

25
00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.420
in a few minutes.

26
00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.900 line:8%
Sales, finance and operations
each ask their own questions.

27
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.660
You see what is happening,
without chasing it.

28
00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.260
You can ask any time.

29
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.750
And the longer it works with
you, the more your company knows.

30
00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:49.590
Install it on a company computer.

31
00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:52.490
Guided self-onboarding
connects your sources.

32
00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:54.010
Where do you start?

33
00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:54.980
With your company.
